.TH "SCMLPICK" "1" "Sep 23, 2025" "Generated on 2025/09/23" "TexNet"
.SH NAME
scmlpick \- TexNet Documentation
.sp
\fBscmlpick\fP is a SeisComP module that performs real\-time seismic phase picking
using machine\-learning models (EQCCT by default), designed for operational networks
and research workflows. It supports multi\-pipeline execution, per\-station configuration
via SeisComP \fBbindings\fP, and \fBplayback\fP for offline reprocessing.
.sp
Seamless integration with \fI\%SeisComP\fP (\fI\%official documentation\fP)
enables direct publishing of \fI\%Pick\fP objects to the messaging system, use of station
bindings, and interoperability with other SeisComP modules.
